{"excerpt_id":"ex_2ae04b870db8_001","source_id":"src_2ae04b870db8","source_hash":"b735bff7bd8358a4ef4aa1859a0c7035c48a77dda5aebddcde5cf4dc664dfabe","text":"Current status and known issues","location_hint":"paragraph 57","char_start":1012,"char_end":1043,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-08T21:14:12.241Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_2ae04b870db8_002","source_id":"src_2ae04b870db8","source_hash":"b735bff7bd8358a4ef4aa1859a0c7035c48a77dda5aebddcde5cf4dc664dfabe","text":"Learn about Nodes 2.0, the new Vue-based node rendering system in ComfyUI that enables faster development and richer interactions.","location_hint":"paragraph 66","char_start":1180,"char_end":1310,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-08T21:14:12.241Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_2ae04b870db8_003","source_id":"src_2ae04b870db8","source_hash":"b735bff7bd8358a4ef4aa1859a0c7035c48a77dda5aebddcde5cf4dc664dfabe","text":"Fetch the complete documentation index at: https://docs.comfy.org/llms.txt","location_hint":"paragraph 69","char_start":1350,"char_end":1424,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-08T21:14:12.241Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_2ae04b870db8_004","source_id":"src_2ae04b870db8","source_hash":"b735bff7bd8358a4ef4aa1859a0c7035c48a77dda5aebddcde5cf4dc664dfabe","text":"Use this file to discover all available pages before exploring further.","location_hint":"paragraph 70","char_start":1426,"char_end":1497,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-08T21:14:12.241Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_2ae04b870db8_005","source_id":"src_2ae04b870db8","source_hash":"b735bff7bd8358a4ef4aa1859a0c7035c48a77dda5aebddcde5cf4dc664dfabe","text":"Nodes 2.0 is now available in ComfyUI Desktop, portable, and stable releases. This update transitions the node system from LiteGraph.js Canvas rendering to a Vue-based architecture, unlocking faster iteration and richer interactions.","location_hint":"paragraph 71","char_start":1499,"char_end":1732,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-08T21:14:12.241Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_2ae04b870db8_006","source_id":"src_2ae04b870db8","source_hash":"b735bff7bd8358a4ef4aa1859a0c7035c48a77dda5aebddcde5cf4dc664dfabe","text":"The previous Canvas rendering system had become a development bottleneck. Even small UI changes often required deep modifications and could take days to implement. This slowed the ability to respond to community feedback and made node customization difficult for developers.\nThe new Vue-based system enables:","location_hint":"paragraph 74","char_start":1759,"char_end":2067,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-08T21:14:12.241Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_2ae04b870db8_007","source_id":"src_2ae04b870db8","source_hash":"b735bff7bd8358a4ef4aa1859a0c7035c48a77dda5aebddcde5cf4dc664dfabe","text":"Faster feature development - UI changes can be implemented more quickly","location_hint":"paragraph 75","char_start":2070,"char_end":2141,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-08T21:14:12.241Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_2ae04b870db8_008","source_id":"src_2ae04b870db8","source_hash":"b735bff7bd8358a4ef4aa1859a0c7035c48a77dda5aebddcde5cf4dc664dfabe","text":"Richer interactions - Dynamic widgets, expandable nodes, and better components","location_hint":"paragraph 76","char_start":2143,"char_end":2221,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-08T21:14:12.241Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_2ae04b870db8_009","source_id":"src_2ae04b870db8","source_hash":"b735bff7bd8358a4ef4aa1859a0c7035c48a77dda5aebddcde5cf4dc664dfabe","text":"A more flexible foundation - Better support for future tools and customization","location_hint":"paragraph 77","char_start":2223,"char_end":2301,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-08T21:14:12.241Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_2ae04b870db8_010","source_id":"src_2ae04b870db8","source_hash":"b735bff7bd8358a4ef4aa1859a0c7035c48a77dda5aebddcde5cf4dc664dfabe","text":"Current status and known issues","location_hint":"paragraph 79","char_start":2312,"char_end":2343,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-08T21:14:12.241Z"}
